HEADLESS-SAFE LOADER BEHAVIOR
- Missing vista/prop mesh: `_get_mesh_and_shape` returns null mesh ->
  `_build_one_draw_item` logs the UE path (`mp`, e.g.
  `/Game/Art/Environment/Urban/WallWindow/SM_ThievesDen_WindowBorder`) via
  `push_warning` (works headless, no GPU/ResourceLoader GUI needed) and
  returns 0 before any mesh/shape/occluder use — never null-crashes.
- Vista replica uses only `BoxMesh`/`SphereMesh` + `StandardMaterial3D`
  (no external assets, no physics queries, safe before first physics frame).

